---
// Module 01: Architectural Pipeline
---

<div class="p-gutter md:p-space-lg lg:p-space-xl space-y-space-lg" id="pipeline">
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between border-b border-border-hairline pb-space-sm gap-space-xs">
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-space-sm">
      <span class="font-label-mono text-label-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-text-secondary font-bold">01 //</span>
      <span class="font-label-mono text-label-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-text-primary font-bold">ARCHITECTURAL PIPELINE</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-space-xs">
      <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-text-primary"></span>
      <span class="font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs uppercase tracking-widest bg-surface-subtle text-text-primary border border-border-hairline px-space-xs py-0.5 font-bold">
        99.999% DETERMINISTIC INVARIANT
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Step Progression Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-border-hairline border border-border-hairline">
    <!-- Stage 01 -->
    <div class="bg-surface-canvas p-space-md flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-surface-subtle transition-none relative group">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border-hairline pb-space-xs mb-space-sm">
          <span class="font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs text-text-secondary font-bold">PHASE 01</span>
          <span class="font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 border border-border-hairline font-bold">SPEC</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm uppercase tracking-tight text-text-primary mb-space-xs">
          RESEARCH &amp; FORMAL SPEC
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-secondary mb-space-md leading-relaxed">
          TLA+ model checking, safety and liveness invariant proving, state machine formulation before a single line of machine code is written.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-space-xs border-t border-border-subtle flex items-center justify-between text-text-secondary font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs">
        <span>INVARIANT DEPTH</span>
        <span class="font-code-block text-code-block text-text-primary font-bold">2.4M STATES</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Stage 02 -->
    <div class="bg-surface-canvas p-space-md flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-surface-subtle transition-none relative group">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border-hairline pb-space-xs mb-space-sm">
          <span class="font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs text-text-secondary font-bold">PHASE 02</span>
          <span class="font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 border border-border-hairline font-bold">KERNEL</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm uppercase tracking-tight text-text-primary mb-space-xs">
          ZERO-COPY MEMORY LAYOUTS
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-secondary mb-space-md leading-relaxed">
          Hardware-aligned cache locality, page-pinned circular ring buffers, and NUMA-aware synchronization primitives without heap locks.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-space-xs border-t border-border-subtle flex items-center justify-between text-text-secondary font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs">
        <span>CACHE HIT RATE</span>
        <span class="font-code-block text-code-block text-text-primary font-bold">L1/L2 &gt; 99.4%</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Stage 03 -->
    <div class="bg-surface-canvas p-space-md flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-surface-subtle transition-none relative group">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border-hairline pb-space-xs mb-space-sm">
          <span class="font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs text-text-secondary font-bold">PHASE 03</span>
          <span class="font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs bg-surface-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 border border-border-hairline font-bold">CORE</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm uppercase tracking-tight text-text-primary mb-space-xs">
          DETERMINISTIC RUNTIME
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-secondary mb-space-md leading-relaxed">
          Explicit seed-controlled pseudo-random execution engines with discrete logical time advancement. Full bit-level replay capability.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-space-xs border-t border-border-subtle flex items-center justify-between text-text-secondary font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs">
        <span>TRACE REPRODUCIBILITY</span>
        <span class="font-code-block text-code-block text-text-primary font-bold">100.00% BITWISE</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Stage 04 -->
    <div class="bg-surface-canvas p-space-md flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-surface-subtle transition-none relative group">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border-hairline pb-space-xs mb-space-sm">
          <span class="font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs text-text-secondary font-bold">PHASE 04</span>
          <span class="font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs bg-surface-subtle text-text-primary px-1.5 py-0.5 border border-border-hairline font-bold">DEPLOY</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm uppercase tracking-tight text-text-primary mb-space-xs">
          CHAOS &amp; SMT VERIFICATION
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-secondary mb-space-md leading-relaxed">
          Jepsen-style network partition injection, LLVM-sanitizer sweeps, and automated SMT assertion extraction at cluster boundary lines.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-space-xs border-t border-border-subtle flex items-center justify-between text-text-secondary font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs">
        <span>DIVERGENCE EVENTS</span>
        <span class="font-code-block text-code-block text-text-primary font-bold">0 RECORDED</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
